Martin\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Italiano con Martin</span></a><details class=\"language-switcher\"><summary aria-label=\"Language\"><span class=\"language-flag\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🇩🇪</span><span class=\"language-current\">Deutsch</span><span class=\"language-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⌄</span></summary><div class=\"language-options\"><a href=\"/grammatica/b2/congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"it\" lang=\"it\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇮🇹</span><span>Italiano</span></a><a href=\"/en/grammar/b2/the-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇬🇧</span><span>English</span></a><a href=\"/es/gramatica/b2/el-congiuntivo-presente-italiano.html\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇪🇸</span><span>Español</span></a><a href=\"/fr/grammaire/b2/le-congiuntivo-presente-italien.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇫🇷</span><span>Français</span></a><a href=\"/cs/gramatika/b2/italsky-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"cs\" lang=\"cs\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇨🇿</span><span>Čeština</span></a><a href=\"/pl/gramatyka/b2/wloski-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"pl\" lang=\"pl\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇵🇱</span><span>Polski</span></a><a href=\"/tr/dilbilgisi/b2/italyanca-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇹🇷</span><span>Türkçe</span></a><a href=\"/de/grammatik/b2/das-italienische-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"de\" lang=\"de\" aria-current=\"page\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇩🇪</span><span>Deutsch</span></a><a href=\"/ja/bunpo/b2/イタリア語の-congiuntivo-presente.html\" hreflang=\"ja\" lang=\"ja\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">🇯🇵</span><span>日本語</span></a></div></details><nav><a href=\"/de/grammatik/\">Grammatik</a><a href=\"/de/lesetexte/\">Lesungen</a><a href=\"/de/wortschatz/\">Wortschatz</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/de/ueber-uns/\">Über uns</a><a class=\"nav-cta\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Buchen Sie auf Preply</a></nav></div></header>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"page-intro\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\"><p class=\"breadcrumbs\"><a href=\"/de/\">Zuhause</a> / <a href=\"/de/grammatik/\">Grammatik</a> / B2 / Das italienische congiuntivo presente</p><p class=\"eyebrow\">Grammatik B2</p><h1>Das italienische congiuntivo presente</h1><p class=\"lead\">Verwenden Sie es nach Meinungen, Zweifeln, Emotionen und Bewertungen: Ich denke, es ist so, ich hoffe, es kommt.</p><div class=\"lesson-meta\"><span>16 Minuten</span><span>10 Übungen</span><span>Niveau B2</span></div><div class=\"lesson-nav\"><a href=\"#forma\">Formular</a><a href=\"#quando\">Wann sollte man es verwenden?</a><a href=\"#irregolari\">Unregelmäßig</a><a href=\"#esercizi\">Übungen</a></div><div class=\"pdf-downloads\" aria-label=\"PDF downloads\"><a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"/pdf/de/das-italienische-congiuntivo-presente-b2.pdf\" download=\"\">PDF B2</a></div></div></section>\n  <section class=\"section compact-top\"><div class=\"container lesson-shell\">\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"forma\"><h2>Regelmäßige Formen</h2><table class=\"conj-table\"><thead><tr><th>Persona</th><th>Parlare</th><th>Prendere</th><th>Partire</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>io</td><td>parli</td><td>prenda</td><td>parta</td></tr><tr><td>tu</td><td>parli</td><td>prenda</td><td>parta</td></tr><tr><td>lui / lei</td><td>parli</td><td>prenda</td><td>parta</td></tr><tr><td>noi</td><td>parliamo</td><td>prendiamo</td><td>partiamo</td></tr><tr><td>voi</td><td>parliate</td><td>prendiate</td><td>partiate</td></tr><tr><td>loro</td><td>parlino</td><td>prendano</td><td>partano</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"mini-note\"><strong>Wichtig:</strong> Ich, du und er/sie haben oft die gleiche Form: dass ich spreche, dass du sprichst, dass er/sie spricht.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"quando\"><h2>Wann sollte man es verwenden?</h2><div class=\"rule-grid\"><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Meinung nicht sicher</strong><br>Ich denke, er ist gut.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Zweifel</strong><br>Ich weiß nicht, ob er heute kommt.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Emotion</strong><br>Ich freue mich, dass du Italienisch lernst.</div><div class=\"rule-card\"><strong>Notwendigkeit</strong><br>Es ist wichtig, dass Sie sich zu Wort melden.</div></div><p class=\"italian-box\"><strong>Praktischer Trick:</strong> Nach Ausdrücken wie „Ich denke, dass, ich glaube, dass, ich hoffe, dass es wichtig ist, dass“ wird häufig der Konjunktiv verwendet.</p></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"irregolari\"><h2>Grundlegende Unregelmäßigkeiten</h2><table class=\"conj-table\"><thead><tr><th>Verbo</th><th>Io / tu / lui</th><th>Noi</th><th>Voi</th><th>Loro</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>essere</td><td>sia</td><td>siamo</td><td>siate</td><td>siano</td></tr><tr><td>avere</td><td>abbia</td><td>abbiamo</td><td>abbiate</td><td>abbiano</td></tr><tr><td>andare</td><td>vada</td><td>andiamo</td><td>andiate</td><td>vadano</td></tr><tr><td>fare</td><td>faccia</td><td>facciamo</td><td>facciate</td><td>facciano</td></tr><tr><td>venire</td><td>venga</td><td>veniamo</td><td>veniate</td><td>vengano</td></tr></tbody></table></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\"><h2>Häufige Fehler</h2><div class=\"mistake-grid\"><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: penso che lui è bravo.</strong>Corretto: penso che lui sia bravo.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: spero che tu vieni.</strong>Corretto: spero che tu venga.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: è importante che voi parlate.</strong>Corretto: è importante che voi parliate.</div><div class=\"mistake\"><strong>Errato: credo che loro hanno tempo.</strong>Corretto: credo che loro abbiano tempo.</div></div></article>\n    <article class=\"lesson-box\" id=\"esercizi\"><h2>Übungen mit sofortigem Feedback</h2><p>Vervollständigen Sie es mit dem Konjunktiv Präsens.</p><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"sia\" data-hint=\"To be: damit er ist.\"><label>1. Penso che Marco ___ simpatico. (essere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"abbia\" data-hint=\"Zu haben: das du hast.\"><label>2. Spero che tu ___ tempo. (avere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"parli\" data-hint=\"Reden: Lass sie reden.\"><label>3. Credo che Anna ___ bene italiano. (parlare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"prendiamo\" data-hint=\"Nehmen: das nehmen wir.\"><label>4. È meglio che noi ___ il treno. (prendere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"partiate\" data-hint=\"Gehen: Lass dich gehen.\"><label>5. È necessario che voi ___ presto. (partire)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"vadano\" data-hint=\"Los: Lass sie gehen.\"><label>6. Dubito che loro ___ a casa. (andare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"faccia\" data-hint=\"Tun: Lass sie tun.\"><label>7. Voglio che lei ___ attenzione. (fare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"venga\" data-hint=\"Komm: lass ihn kommen.\"><label>8. Spero che Paolo ___ alla lezione. (venire)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"studino\" data-hint=\"Studieren: Lass sie lernen.\"><label>9. Sono felice che gli studenti ___ molto. (studiare)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"exercise\" data-answer=\"siate\" data-hint=\"Sein: dass du bist.\"><label>10. Mi sembra che voi ___ pronti. (essere)</label><input autocomplete=\"off\"><div class=\"feedback\"></div></div><div class=\"score-card\"><div><strong>Ihr Ergebnis</strong><p id=\"score-text\">0 richtige Antworten von 10</p></div><strong id=\"score-percent\">0%</strong></div><div class=\"exercise-actions\"><button class=\"reset-btn\" id=\"reset-exercises\" type=\"button\">Beginnen Sie erneut</button><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"../\">Zurück zur Grammatik</a></div></article>\n  </div></section>\n  <section class=\"conversion-section teacher-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"teacher-cta-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Italiano con Martin</p><h2>Wählen Sie, mit wem Sie Italienisch lernen</h2></div><p>Zwei Lehrkräfte, zwei Perspektiven. Wählen Sie den Ansatz, der zu Ihren Interessen passt.</p></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-options\"><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/martin-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Martin</strong><span>Wissenschaft, Technologie und Etymologie</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.com/it/tutor/5086125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mit Martin lernen</a></article><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../../assets/licia-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Licia\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div><strong>Licia</strong><span>Kunst, Geduld und Grammatik</span></div><a class=\"button light\" href=\"https://preply.in/LICIA6IT2176799611?ts=17865248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Mit Licia lernen</a></article></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-links\"><a href=\"/de/ueber-uns/\">Martin und Licia kennenlernen</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/59167434075?text=Hallo%2C%20ich%20m%C3%B6chte%20Informationen%20zum%20Italienischunterricht%20mit%20Martin%20oder%20Licia.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Per WhatsApp schreiben</a></div></div></section>\n</main>\n<footer><div class=\"container footer-grid\"><div><strong>Italiano con Martin</strong><p>Klare Grammatik, benotete Lesungen und Online-Lektionen.</p></div><div><a href=\"/de/grammatik/\">Grammatik</a><a href=\"/de/lesetexte/\">Lesungen</a><a href=\"/de/wortschatz/\">Wortschatz</a><a class=\"about-link\" href=\"/de/ueber-uns/\">Über uns</a></div></div></footer><script src=\"../../../assets/grammar-exercises.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"../../../script.js\"></script>\n\n\n\n</body></html>";
